  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 10.871pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(79.37pt, 201.308pt, "frequencies. Beyond the reflective moiré metasurfaces demonstrated here, the method can potentially")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 10.882pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(79.37pt, 217.566pt, "be extended to transmissive and coaxial-fed radiating configurations, offering a versatile platform for")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 10.909pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(79.37pt, 233.825pt, "reconfigurable beamforming devices.")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 11.955pt, weight: "bold", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(79.37pt, 261.47pt, "4")
  #line-at(93.118pt, 261.47pt, "Methods")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 10.959pt, weight: "bold", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(79.37pt, 283.382pt, "4.1")
  #line-at(100.192pt, 283.382pt, "Fabrication and measurement")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 10.832pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(79.032pt, 302.341pt, "The reflective moiré metasurface comprises two independently fabricated metallic metasurface layers,")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 11.018pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(79.37pt, 318.6pt, "a dielectric spacer, and a metallic ground plane. The metallic patterns were fabricated on ultrathin")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 10.86pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(79.37pt, 334.859pt, "dielectric substrates with a thickness of 0.05 mm and a copper thickness of 0.035 mm. A 3-mm-thick")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 11.018pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(79.37pt, 351.118pt, "low-permittivity foam spacer was inserted between the metasurface layers and the ground plane to")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 10.816pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(79.37pt, 367.377pt, "establish the reflective configuration. The dielectric substrates have a relative permittivity of 3.5 and a")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 10.969pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(79.37pt, 383.636pt, "loss tangent of 0.03, whereas the foam spacer has a relative permittivity of 1.1 and a loss tangent of")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 10.964pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(79.37pt, 399.895pt, "0.001. The metasurface features a circular aperture with a diameter of 250 mm, ensuring a constant")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 10.909pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(79.37pt, 416.154pt, "effective aperture during relative rotation.")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 10.854pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(93.552pt, 432.413pt, "Experimental characterization was performed in a microwave anechoic chamber. The metasurface")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 11.018pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(79.37pt, 448.672pt, "layers")
  #line-at(108.612pt, 448.672pt, "were")
  #line-at(133.293pt, 448.672pt, "fabricated")
  #line-at(181.107pt, 448.672pt, "on")
  #line-at(195.617pt, 448.672pt, "flexible")
  #line-at(232.003pt, 448.672pt, "dielectric")
  #line-at(277.013pt, 448.672pt, "substrates")
  #line-at(324.115pt, 448.672pt, "using")
  #line-at(351.61pt, 448.672pt, "standard")
  #line-at(392.536pt, 448.672pt, "printed")
  #line-at(427.665pt, 448.672pt, "circuit")
  #line-at(459.478pt, 448.672pt, "board")
  #line-at(488.197pt, 448.672pt, "(PCB)")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 10.799pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(79.37pt, 464.931pt, "technology (Supplementary Information 4). After adjusting the relative twist angle, the two layers were")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 10.947pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(79.37pt, 481.19pt, "assembled in a custom-designed fixture and mounted on a horizontal wooden platform. A circularly")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 10.838pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(79.37pt, 497.449pt, "polarized horn antenna was used to illuminate the metasurface with a left-handed circularly polarized")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 10.893pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(79.01pt, 513.708pt, "(LHCP) wave, approximating plane-wave incidence. A second circularly polarized horn antenna was")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 10.799pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(79.37pt, 529.967pt, "positioned in the far-field region to receive the right-handed circularly polarized (RHCP) reflected wave.")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 10.915pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(79.032pt, 546.226pt, "The scattering parameters (S-parameters) were measured using a vector network analyzer connected")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 10.909pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(79.37pt, 562.485pt, "to both antennas, from which the three-dimensional far-field radiation patterns were reconstructed.")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 10.959pt, weight: "bold", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(79.37pt, 585.988pt, "4.2")
  #line-at(100.192pt, 585.988pt, "Fourier expansion of a two-dimensional periodic pattern")
