  #line-at(79.37pt, 291.746pt, "of the nonzero-order Fourier coefficients are governed by the geometry and spatial arrangement of")
  #line-at(79.37pt, 308.005pt, "the metallic regions within the unit cell. For the hexagonal patterns, the Fourier coefficients can be")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 10.898pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
